            <h3 class="ind-art__h2">Related application pages</h3>
            <ul class="ind-art__related">
              <li><a href="#upholstery-furniture">Upholstery &amp; Furniture</a><span> &mdash; soft furnishing and interior fabric applications</span></li>
              <li><a href="#warehousing-logistics">Warehousing &amp; Logistics</a><span> &mdash; load restraint and cargo management</span></li>
